      "side": 1,
      "message": "Supposing that you have a good way to start the sequence, you might need to do something like this:\n1. If the partner currently sends Accept with no delay, change it to send with a reasonable delay.\n2. In your test code that sends the FRS signal, also schedule a Hard Reset to send later but earlier than the Accept.\n3. The Accept will still happen, but it probably won\u0027t affect the test.\n\nIt\u0027s possible that this would run into the kind of timing issues that I\u0027ve seen before, and we might need to generalize the concept of the partner emulator responding in a non-zero amount of time.",
      "revId": "4affa763051780e18caf789c0164546c15bebf07",
